    Does not access your contacts, location, camera, microphone, or any device sensors.

    Does not use analytics, crash reporting, or advertising SDKs.

2. Local Data Storage
All recipes, notes, and preferences you create within the App are stored only on your device. We have no access to this data, and it is never uploaded to any server.

3. External Links
The App contains links to external websites (such as baking resources, donation platforms, and social media). When you tap these links, your device’s browser opens the website. Our Dough is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those external sites.

4. Internet Access
The App requires internet permission solely to open external links. No data is sent over the network otherwise.

5. Children’s Privacy
Our Dough is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect any information from children.

6. Changes to This Policy
We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted within the App or on our listing page.

